    "description": "Favorite readings\r\nIn this APP, you can read all kinds of books freely, which covering a rich variety of genres like Romance, Werewolf, Fantasy, CEO, Mafia, Youth, LGBTQ+, and so on. And all books and content are displayed by a screen elaborately and recommendation specially. \r\n\r\nFavorite subscription\r\nIn order to achieve the most convenient and the most cost-effective reading of all books, we launch the subscription package in this app. By subscribing to our Membership, you will get the exclusive benefits, such as read in free, a free trial, one-button subscription. \r\n\r\nFavorite app team\r\nWe encourage every user to express valuable suggestions and ideas regarding all aspects of our app by sending a feedback to us. And we will take every feedback into our account and try our best to optimize the reading experience and product functionality of each place in our app.\r\n\r\nNow, don\u2019t hesitate anymore, download our app and give us a chance to be your favorite reading place!",
